{"about_the_game":"A relaxed and lightweight roguelite tower defense game unfolding on a conveyor belt sushi restaurant!\ud83c\udf63\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd16<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Flow:</h2>The game consists of a repetition of the Card Purchase Phase and the Sushi Wave Phase. Players need to effectively pick up weapons, towers, and cards to gain power against the sushi waves.<br><br><strong>Card Purchase/Effect Activation Phase</strong><br>Purchase cards to increase your stats. Cards activate their effects at the start of each round.<br>The variety of cards available increases with Sushi Tier, allowing more cards to be activated at once.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/7cf00d6b5b2b575c3e9575a80650eb37.poster.avif?t=1759407059\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/7cf00d6b5b2b575c3e9575a80650eb37.webm?t=1759407059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/7cf00d6b5b2b575c3e9575a80650eb37.mp4?t=1759407059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong>Sushi Wave Phase</strong><br>By defeating sushi and accumulating experience points, you can raise your Sushi Tier.<br>If you can't handle enemy attacks and your HP drops to zero, it's game over. After defeating a certain number of enemies, you enter the purchase phase.<br>Ultimately, if you can survive until the set time, you clear the game.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/80fabcc838bc3fa3c29ad7701b0f4dc9.poster.avif?t=1759407059\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/80fabcc838bc3fa3c29ad7701b0f4dc9.webm?t=1759407059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/80fabcc838bc3fa3c29ad7701b0f4dc9.mp4?t=1759407059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of &quot;sushininjarobot TD&quot;:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unpredictable Progression: </strong>With different card combinations each time, there are countless ways to win!<br></li><li><strong>Simple Gameplay: </strong>Operate your ninja robot and quickly deal with the flowing sushi. If you keep missing them, it's game over!<br></li><li><strong>Easy to Enjoy:</strong> Perfect for a short break!<br></li><li><strong>Unique Hand-Drawn Graphics: </strong>Graphics made during a short break!<br></li><li><strong>Unnecessarily Long Opening:</strong> A unique opening specific to this game!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What &quot;sushininjarobot TD&quot; does not offer:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Elaborate puzzle-like level design</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video/Streaming Guidelines</h2>You are free to create monetized videos and streams without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spaceship Pora Pora Pora","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3019000/5e498095ef005f705fc0327767e7a0a399a46b51.jpg"},{"name":"That's the new one!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3019000/c29bce5f507313c88d834a5f5f9074f15083bc42.jpg"},{"name":"It's getting pretty good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3019000/f56aeeeb4cf0dfd32ca48ff38e14ec50330faf12.jpg"},{"name":"I am rich!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3019000/eaa66a2704567cbf3eb0b38b9bd69a027c308c98.